    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey we r having a big issue at the plant. the sublimation prints arent transferring right on the new polyester blend we got. the colors look faded and patchy even though the heat press is set to the standard 400F. we checked the pressure and it seems even. any idea what might be causing the ink to not transfer fully?",
